  "body": " Earth's Gravity at the Moon    Calculate the magnitude of the Earth's gravitational field at the location of the Moon.  Use your result from part (a) to calculate the gravitational force of the Earth on the Moon.  Use your result from part (a) to calculate the gravitational force of the Earth on a astronaut standing on the surface of the Moon.    "
