  "number": "0.68",
  "title": "Gravitational Field via Integration I.",
  "body": " Gravitational Field via Integration I   A rod lies on the -axis with one end at and the other end at . The rod is not uniform, and its mass per unit length varies as , where is a constant.  Determine the total mass of the rod.  Find the gravitational field at the origin due to the rod.     Figure for Problem A .     "
